+   — no component changes needed beyond the toggle itself. Emerald stays the
+   one functional accent color in both themes (same brand, just recolored
+   for contrast against a dark surface); gold keeps its "rare highlight"
+   role rather than becoming a second competing accent. */
+:root[data-theme="dark"] {
+  --background: #0e1310;
+  --foreground: #edf1ea;
+  --surface: #161d19;
+  --border: #283229;
+
+  --gold-50: #241f10;
